sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant I as incident-service
    participant CB as Circuit breaker + fallback
    participant R as responder-service (DOWN)
    participant DB as incident_db
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    C->>G: POST /api/incidents
    G->>I: POST /incidents
    I->>DB: INSERT incident, status REPORTED (commit)
    I->>CB: assign(incident)
    CB-xR: call fails: connection refused / 2 s timeout / HTTP 5xx / breaker OPEN
    CB-->>I: fallback returns "no responder"
    I->>DB: UPDATE status PENDING (commit)
    I-)MQ: publish incident.pending
    I-->>G: 201 PENDING (fast, no error)
    G-->>C: 201 PENDING
    Note over C,MQ: login, listing incidents and notifications keep working - only /api/responders answers 503
    Note over I,R: later: admin calls POST /api/incidents/ID/dispatch (the same assign call) and the status becomes ASSIGNED